      <activity id="cf62dcb8-4157-512f-97a5-1ac0f5be5271" activityNameId="abc16cb3-7538-5cbf-b4ff-c03c7d34859a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, medium voltage, aluminium industry, at grid</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, medium voltage, aluminium industry, at grid
This dataset describes the transformation from high to medium voltage as well as the transmission of electricity at medium voltage.;
UUID: bddaebbf-2c6c-3e2c-a714-c6ffb4507b88
Included are the electricity production in European Aluminium Industry, the transmission network and direct SF6-emissions to air. Electricity losses during medium-voltage transmission and transformation from high-voltage are accounted for.
Location: Data apply to public and self producers. Geographical classification according to IEA. Assumptions for transmission network, losses and emissions are based on UTCE data.
Technology: Average technology used to transmit and distribute electricity. Includes underground and overhead lines, as well as air-, vacuum- and SF6-insulated high-to-medium voltage switching stations. Electricity production according to related datasets
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bddaebbf-2c6c-3e2c-a714-c6ffb4507b88.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
